# Copy to /etc/creative-strategist/web.env on the box (owner root, chmod 600).
# This is what the Next.js SERVER process reads at runtime -- NOT the same
# thing as web/.env.local, which is what gets baked into the client bundle
# at `npm run build` time (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY).
# Create web/.env.local on the box separately, before the first setup.sh run.

CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
